{"id":"fff1247dc8d93b4d","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-tm-output.md","title":"Turing Machine Output","display":"df-tm-output — Turing Machine Output","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-tm-output","aliases":["88-df-tm-output"],"display":"df-tm-output — Turing Machine Output","depends_on":["[[88-df-turing-machine]]","[[88-df-tm-initial-configuration]]","[[88-df-tm-computation]]","[[88-df-tm-halts]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-tm-output"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-tm-output</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tm-output — Turing Machine Output"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f8f3a8be6b88d18\" href=\"?note=3f8f3a8be6b88d18\" title=\"88-df-tm-initial-configuration\">88-df-tm-initial-configuration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"25d15dae418e51ef\" href=\"?note=25d15dae418e51ef\" title=\"88-df-tm-computation\">88-df-tm-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a93cc0702f1280f5\" href=\"?note=a93cc0702f1280f5\" title=\"88-df-tm-halts\">88-df-tm-halts</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M \\in \\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M \\in \\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> (Turing machine, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w \\in \\Sigma_M^*\">\\(w \\in \\Sigma_M^*\\)</span> (input word)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y \\in (\\Gamma_M\\setminus\\{B_M\\})^*\">\\(y \\in (\\Gamma_M\\setminus\\{B_M\\})^*\\)</span> (finite output word)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Output}_M(w)\">\\(\\mathrm{Output}_M(w)\\)</span> (partial output function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Halts}_M(w)\">\\(\\mathrm{Halts}_M(w)\\)</span> (halting predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a93cc0702f1280f5\" href=\"?note=a93cc0702f1280f5\" title=\"88-df-tm-halts\">88-df-tm-halts</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Init}_M(w,c_0)\">\\(\\mathrm{Init}_M(w,c_0)\\)</span> (initial-configuration predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3f8f3a8be6b88d18\" href=\"?note=3f8f3a8be6b88d18\" title=\"88-df-tm-initial-configuration\">88-df-tm-initial-configuration</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computation}_M(c_0,\\ldots,c_n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Computation}_M(c_0,\\ldots,c_n)\\)</span> (finite computation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"25d15dae418e51ef\" href=\"?note=25d15dae418e51ef\" title=\"88-df-tm-computation\">88-df-tm-computation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M,q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^M\">\\(q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M,q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^M\\)</span> (halting-state projections, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}output} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Output}_M(w)=y\n\\leftrightarrow\nM\\in\\mathrm{TM}\n\\land\\mathrm{Halts}_M(w)\n\\land y\\in(\\Gamma_M\\setminus\\{B_M\\})^*\n\\land\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists c_0,\\ldots,c_n\\;\\exists q\\;\\exists T\\;\\exists i\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Init}_M(w,c_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Computation}_M(c_0,\\ldots,c_n)\n\\land q\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M,q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^M\\}\n\\land c_n=\\langle q,T,i\\rangle\n\\land\\forall j&lt;|y|\\;(T(j)=y_j)\n\\land T(|y|)=B_M\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}output} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Output}_M(w)=y\n\\leftrightarrow\nM\\in\\mathrm{TM}\n\\land\\mathrm{Halts}_M(w)\n\\land y\\in(\\Gamma_M\\setminus\\{B_M\\})^*\n\\land\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists c_0,\\ldots,c_n\\;\\exists q\\;\\exists T\\;\\exists i\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Init}_M(w,c_0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Computation}_M(c_0,\\ldots,c_n)\n\\land q\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M,q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^M\\}\n\\land c_n=\\langle q,T,i\\rangle\n\\land\\forall j&lt;|y|\\;(T(j)=y_j)\n\\land T(|y|)=B_M\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Output}_M(w)\">\\(\\mathrm{Output}_M(w)\\)</span> : Turing 机 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 在输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 上的部分输出函数</li>\n<li>输出定义为最终纸带从位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 到首个空白符之前的有限词</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 不停机，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Output}_M(w)\">\\(\\mathrm{Output}_M(w)\\)</span> 未定义（部分函数）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc676c7a4a4b11","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-initial-configuration","status